# lane.slowtier2 2026-09-28: two frames added after the mark (play1, play2); the route to the mark is unchanged (docs/lanes/slowtier2/addshots.py).
# Crash Twinsanity (56550036): one route. It declines the save game, so the
# disk is the same after every run. PLAYED by nav.py on the Thor,
# 2026-09-26 23:00 PDT (lane.titleroutes HELD session
# crash-twinsanity.first-run-20260926T230002).
#
#   LOADING -> title "Press START button" (START) -> New Game / Load Game /
#   Options, cursor on New Game (A) -> "Checking hard disk" -> "No saved
#   games found. Would you like to create a save game?" YES / NO / CONTINUE
#   WITHOUT SAVING: one left-stick push down, held 1.5 s (A) -> intro FMV
#   (START did not skip it; A did) -> "AUTOSAVE DISABLED ... CONTINUE" (A)
#   -> the first level, on a beach: wumpa counter 0, 4 lives.
#
# Player control: LY min for 1.5 s ran Crash forward past a palm tree (nav
# frames 009 -> 010). Long stretched polygons cross the screen from the
# start (a rendering defect, not a menu). The play pattern runs, jumps and
# spins.
#
wait 25.3
shot boot
wait 27.5
shot l2
wait 12.7
press START 300
wait 5.2
shot s1
wait 11.2
press A 300
wait 6.3
shot new
wait 17.5
shot hd2
wait 11.3
axis LY max
wait 1.9
axis LY mid
wait 1.2
shot d1
wait 13.8
press A 300
wait 6.1
shot a1
wait 11.7
press START 300
wait 8.2
shot skip
wait 13.0
press A 300
wait 10.2
shot skip2
wait 11.9
press A 300
wait 7.6
shot play
wait 12.5
